Under `--modular-termination`, a library with a least or greatest predicate or lemma can now be built (https://github.com/erniecohen/dafny/issues/461). The build no longer counts the `{:axiom}` that Dafny puts on the generated prefix predicate or lemma as an assumption of the library; attributes and statements that the user writes on the extreme predicate or lemma still refuse it.
